WEBVTT

00:00:06.617 --> 00:00:08.911
(scoffs) Tourists.

00:00:08.995 --> 00:00:11.164
Barfed on by a plant.

00:00:11.247 --> 00:00:12.540
-Awesome.
-Awesome.

00:00:13.249 --> 00:00:14.292
Say something.

00:00:14.375 --> 00:00:18.588
Uh... thanks for saving us.

00:00:18.671 --> 00:00:21.799
Buck, will you help us find
the floppy green thing?

00:00:21.883 --> 00:00:23.134
-That's not necessary.
-Whoa.

00:00:23.217 --> 00:00:24.969
Yes, it is.

00:00:25.052 --> 00:00:26.596
Hmm.

00:00:26.679 --> 00:00:28.598
All right, I'll help you,

00:00:28.681 --> 00:00:30.391
but I got rules.

00:00:30.474 --> 00:00:34.770
Rule #1: always listen to Buck.

00:00:34.854 --> 00:00:38.524
Rule #2: stay in the middle of the trail.

00:00:38.608 --> 00:00:40.568
Rule #3:

00:00:44.864 --> 00:00:47.241
He who has gas
travels at the back of the pack.

00:00:48.367 --> 00:00:50.703
(groans)

00:00:50.786 --> 00:00:53.372
Come on, then. Chop-chop.

00:00:53.456 --> 00:00:55.750
We should all have our heads examined.

00:00:55.833 --> 00:00:57.335
BUCK:
That's rule #4.

00:00:57.418 --> 00:00:59.837
Now let's go find your friend.

00:01:01.547 --> 00:01:04.508
(dinosaur growling)

00:01:05.301 --> 00:01:07.303
(frantic chittering) (frantic chittering)

00:01:07.386 --> 00:01:09.388
(rumbling)

00:01:11.432 --> 00:01:12.934
(snoring)

00:01:13.017 --> 00:01:15.311
(sleepy muttering)

00:01:16.020 --> 00:01:18.272
(low growling)

00:01:18.356 --> 00:01:19.357
(gasps)

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:20.399
(dino baby whining)

00:01:20.483 --> 00:01:21.442
No, it's okay.

00:01:21.525 --> 00:01:22.652
It's okay. Don't worry.

00:01:22.735 --> 00:01:24.570
We're going to be fine.

00:01:24.654 --> 00:01:26.280
Please stop swaying.

00:01:26.364 --> 00:01:27.448
I'm a little nauseous.

00:01:27.531 --> 00:01:29.200
(suppressed gagging)

00:01:32.578 --> 00:01:33.579
SID:
See?

00:01:33.663 --> 00:01:35.581
She's putting us dow...

00:01:35.665 --> 00:01:38.376
(screaming)

00:01:38.459 --> 00:01:43.047
No! I'm too young to be eaten!

00:01:43.130 --> 00:01:44.090
(snapping)

00:01:44.173 --> 00:01:45.591
SID (echoing):
Whoa.

00:01:45.675 --> 00:01:47.343
Nice mucus.

00:01:47.426 --> 00:01:49.512
And I don't say that to everyone.

00:01:49.595 --> 00:01:51.347
(muffled shouting)

00:01:53.766 --> 00:01:54.809
(squeaky grunting)

00:01:56.227 --> 00:01:57.478
(groaning)

00:01:57.561 --> 00:02:00.314
(low growling)

00:02:00.398 --> 00:02:02.483
(screaming)

00:02:02.566 --> 00:02:04.235
Listen, families get complicated.

00:02:04.318 --> 00:02:06.195
Maybe we can work something out.
(screams)

00:02:06.279 --> 00:02:08.447
I can take them Sunday to Tuesday.

00:02:08.531 --> 00:02:09.865
Wednesday to Friday?

00:02:09.949 --> 00:02:11.742
Weekends?
(screams)

00:02:12.743 --> 00:02:15.288
(grunts)

00:02:15.371 --> 00:02:16.372
(grunting)

00:02:18.374 --> 00:02:20.042
(chuckling):
Oh, it's okay.

00:02:20.126 --> 00:02:21.836
Mama's okay.

00:02:21.919 --> 00:02:23.963
(grunts, gasps)

00:02:24.046 --> 00:02:27.008
If you eat me,
it will send a bad message.

00:02:27.091 --> 00:02:29.552
(growls)

00:02:29.635 --> 00:02:31.387
(dino babies growling)

00:02:31.470 --> 00:02:32.430
Ha!

00:02:32.513 --> 00:02:34.890
Score one for the sloth.

00:02:34.974 --> 00:02:36.183
(snorts angrily)

00:02:36.767 --> 00:02:37.977
(screaming)

00:02:38.686 --> 00:02:39.812
(groaning)

00:02:39.895 --> 00:02:42.023
And the score's all tied up.

00:02:46.902 --> 00:02:49.405
Do you think the beast will find Sid?

00:02:49.488 --> 00:02:52.158
Or, uh, more importantly, us?

00:02:52.241 --> 00:02:54.285
Rudy? Are you joking?

00:02:54.368 --> 00:02:55.661
He's relentless.

00:02:55.745 --> 00:02:56.871
He knows all.

00:02:56.954 --> 00:02:57.872
Sees all.

00:02:57.955 --> 00:03:00.374
Eats all.

00:03:00.458 --> 00:03:02.543
So that's a yes.

00:03:02.626 --> 00:03:04.545
Uh...

00:03:06.630 --> 00:03:08.007
Hey, get off my lawn.

00:03:08.090 --> 00:03:09.842
Go on. Shoo.

00:03:14.930 --> 00:03:16.724
I knew that guy when
he was a caterpillar.

00:03:16.807 --> 00:03:19.143
You know, before he "came out."

00:03:20.853 --> 00:03:23.189
So you're just living
down here by your wits,

00:03:23.272 --> 00:03:24.440
all on your own,

00:03:24.523 --> 00:03:25.775
no responsibilities?

00:03:25.858 --> 00:03:26.901
Not a one.

00:03:26.984 --> 00:03:28.069
It's incredible.

00:03:28.152 --> 00:03:29.904
No dependence, no limits.

00:03:29.987 --> 00:03:32.531
It's the greatest life
a single guy could have.

00:03:32.615 --> 00:03:33.449
Hear that?

00:03:33.532 --> 00:03:35.409
This is my kind of place.

00:03:35.493 --> 00:03:36.452
Hello?

00:03:36.535 --> 00:03:37.453
Yeah, no, no.

00:03:37.536 --> 00:03:38.788
No, I can't talk right now.

00:03:38.871 --> 00:03:40.748
Yeah, no,
I'm trying to recover a dead sloth.

00:03:40.831 --> 00:03:41.749
(chuckles)

00:03:44.251 --> 00:03:45.544
They're following me.

00:03:45.628 --> 00:03:46.545
I know.

00:03:46.629 --> 00:03:48.547
They think I'm crazy.

00:03:48.631 --> 00:03:49.590
No, oh, okay.

00:03:49.673 --> 00:03:51.092
We're going into the Chasm of Death.

00:03:51.175 --> 00:03:52.510
I'm-I'm gonna lose you.

00:03:52.593 --> 00:03:54.178
(whispering):
Yeah, I love you, too.

00:03:54.261 --> 00:03:55.304
All right, good-bye.

00:03:55.388 --> 00:03:56.514
Good-bye, good-bye.

00:03:56.597 --> 00:03:58.641
Okay, follow me.

00:03:58.724 --> 00:04:00.768
That's you in three weeks.

00:04:17.410 --> 00:04:19.078
(faint splash)

00:04:19.161 --> 00:04:22.164
EDDIE: So, why do they call it
the Chasm of Death?

00:04:22.248 --> 00:04:24.458
BUCK:
Well, we tried Big Smelly Crack,

00:04:24.542 --> 00:04:27.378
but, uh, that just made
everybody giggle.

00:04:27.461 --> 00:04:28.629
MANNY:
Well, now what?

00:04:28.712 --> 00:04:29.588
(slicing)

00:04:32.258 --> 00:04:33.926
Madame.

00:04:34.009 --> 00:04:36.011
Whoa. She is not doing that.

00:04:36.095 --> 00:04:37.555
B-b-b-buh...

00:04:37.638 --> 00:04:39.473
Rule #1.

00:04:40.766 --> 00:04:41.851
Ooh, ooh, ooh!

00:04:41.934 --> 00:04:43.894
Ah. Come on, mammoth.

00:04:43.978 --> 00:04:45.938
-You're supposed to have a good memory.
-(hollow thumping)

00:04:46.021 --> 00:04:47.731
Always listen to Buck.

00:04:49.024 --> 00:04:51.527
(creaking)

00:04:52.653 --> 00:04:53.571
BUCK:
Now,

00:04:53.654 --> 00:04:54.864
eyes forward,

00:04:54.947 --> 00:04:56.449
backs straight

00:04:56.532 --> 00:04:58.242
and... oh, yes,
breathe in the toxic fumes,

00:04:58.325 --> 00:04:59.285
and you'll probably die.

00:04:59.368 --> 00:05:00.494
Toxic fumes?!

00:05:00.578 --> 00:05:02.746
Just another day in paradise.

00:05:02.830 --> 00:05:03.706
Wait.

00:05:04.707 --> 00:05:07.251
-(inhales deeply)
-Geronimo!

00:05:12.923 --> 00:05:14.967
(creaking)

00:05:17.470 --> 00:05:19.054
Ellie, you okay?

00:05:19.138 --> 00:05:20.639
You have to try this!

00:05:20.723 --> 00:05:23.058
All right, now,
pile on, everyone.

00:05:23.142 --> 00:05:24.768
Couldn't be easier.

00:05:26.604 --> 00:05:29.231
(creaking)

00:05:29.315 --> 00:05:30.691
BUCK:
Don't panic!

00:05:30.774 --> 00:05:33.194
Just some, uh,
technical difficulties.

00:05:33.277 --> 00:05:34.278
(grunts)

00:05:34.361 --> 00:05:35.821
Keep holding it in, boys!

00:05:35.905 --> 00:05:38.824
(muffled grunts)

00:05:38.908 --> 00:05:40.868
(exhales)
I can't take it anymore.

00:05:40.951 --> 00:05:42.453
He breathed it.

00:05:42.536 --> 00:05:44.455
(gasps)
And now I'm breathing it!

00:05:44.538 --> 00:05:46.582
(both gagging)

00:05:46.665 --> 00:05:48.417
(coughing, gasping)

00:05:48.501 --> 00:05:50.211
(high-pitched):
Hey, we're not dead.

00:05:50.294 --> 00:05:52.129
(high-pitched):
You sound ridiculous.

00:05:52.213 --> 00:05:54.298
Me? You should hear you!

00:05:54.381 --> 00:05:56.592
(both laughing)

00:05:58.427 --> 00:05:59.512
All right, all right.

00:05:59.595 --> 00:06:01.222
And a-one, and a-two.

00:06:01.305 --> 00:06:04.475
♪ Christmas, Christmastime
is here... ♪

00:06:04.558 --> 00:06:06.268
Stop! Are you crazy?

00:06:06.352 --> 00:06:08.062
-(Crash and Eddie laughing)
-(inhales)

00:06:08.145 --> 00:06:09.647
(high-pitched):
That's not poison.

00:06:09.730 --> 00:06:11.023
Huh?

00:06:11.106 --> 00:06:13.400
(laughing)

00:06:13.817 --> 00:06:16.320
(laughing)

00:06:16.403 --> 00:06:18.239
That is so disturbing.

